# UI Component Patterns

RULE: All UI components use the shared ui-kit design system. Pages use AppShell. Entity names use EntityLink. Cross-surface navigation uses CrossLink. Data tables use the shared table classes. New shared components go in unified-trading-ui-kit, never in an individual UI repo.

WHY: the UIs sharing one design system (globals.css, AppShell, SidebarNav) is the only reason they look consistent. Breaking this pattern creates visual drift.

## Two UI Architectures

| Repo | Framework | Routing | Build |
|---|---|---|---|
| **unified-trading-system-ui** (unified platform — consolidated, includes former user-management) | Next.js 16 App Router | File-system (`app/` with route groups) | `pnpm build` (next build) |
| **deployment-ui** (the remaining Vite satellite) | Vite 6 + React Router 6 | Declarative (`<Routes>` + `<Route>`) | `npx vite build` |

The unified platform (unified-trading-system-ui) uses **Next.js 16 App Router** with route groups for public/portal/internal tiers; the formerly-separate analytics/trading/ML/reporting/ops surfaces were consolidated into it (2026-05). `deployment-ui` remains a Vite + React Router satellite. Both share the same design tokens and ui-kit components. (`user-management-ui` is ARCHIVED — folded into unified-trading-system-ui; do NOT reference.)

## Design System Tokens (globals.css)

```
Backgrounds:  #0a0a0b → #111113 → #18181b → #1c1c1f → #2a2a2e
Text:         #fafafa (primary) → #a1a1aa → #71717a → #52525b (muted)
Accent:       #22d3ee (cyan) with rgba(34,211,238,0.15) dim overlay
Status:       green=#4ade80  amber=#fbbf24  red=#f87171  purple=#a78bfa  blue=#60a5fa
Fonts:        IBM Plex Sans (UI), JetBrains Mono (data/values)
Radii:        6/8/12/16px (--radius-sm/md/lg/xl)
PnL:          --color-pnl-positive=#4ade80  --color-pnl-negative=#f87171
```

## AppShell Pattern (every UI)

```tsx
import { AppShell } from "@unified-trading/ui-kit";

export default function App() {
  return (
    <AppShell
      appName="Trading Command Center"
      appDescription="live trading, risk, alerts"
      icon={<Activity />}
      iconColor="#4ade80"
      version="v0.1.0"
      nav={NAV_SECTIONS}
      defaultRoute="/positions"
      healthUrl={API_URL + "/health"}
      authWrapper={(c) => <AuthProvider config={cfg}><RequireAuth>{c}</RequireAuth></AuthProvider>}
    >
      <Routes>...</Routes>
    </AppShell>
  );
}
```

